    },
    {
      "text": "からだから　かいでんぱを　はなち\nあいてに　あびせる　ことによって\nとくこうを　がくっと　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "몸에서 발생시킨 괴전파를\n상대에게 쏘아\n특수공격을 크게 떨어뜨린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從身體發出怪異電波影響對手，\n大幅降低對手的特攻。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le corps du lanceur produit des ondes anormales\nqui enveloppent l’ennemi et diminuent beaucoup\nson Attaque Spéciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Körper des Anwenders erzeugt mysteriöse Wellen\nund senkt den Spezial-Angriff des Zieles dadurch stark.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario irradia unas raras ondas que, al alcanzar a un\noponente, hacen que disminuya mucho su Ataque\nEspecial.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Il corpo di chi la usa emette onde anomale che\ninvestono il bersaglio, riducendone di molto\nl’Attacco Speciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user’s body generates an eerie impulse.\nExposing the target to it harshly lowers the target’s\nSp. Atk stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "体から　かいでんぱを　放ち\n相手に　浴びせる　ことによって\n特攻を　がくっと　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "从身体放射出怪异电波，\n让对手沐浴其中，\n从而大幅降低其特攻。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
